{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"সুনান আবু দাউদ","section":{"42":"Model Behavior of the Prophet (Kitab Al-Sunnah)"},"section_detail":{"42":{"hadithnumber_first":4596,"hadithnumber_last":4772,"arabicnumber_first":4596,"arabicnumber_last":4772,"name_native":"সুন্নাহ অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4640,"arabicnumber":4640,"text":"। মাকহুল (রহঃ) সূত্রে বর্ণিত। রাসূলুল্লাহ সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম বলেছেনঃ তুমুল যুদ্ধের সময় মুসলিমদের সমাবেশ স্থলের নাম হলো গুতাহ।[1] সহীহ।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":42,"hadith":45}}]}